{"benchmark": "ifeval", "task_id": "1092", "sample_idx": 28, "model_name": "nvidia/llama-3.3-nemotron-super-49b-v1", "content": "**Discovering Japan: A Whirlwind Adventure**\n\nMy recent trip to Japan was a sensory overload in the best possible way. From bustling cities to serene landscapes, this country seamlessly blends tradition with modernity.\n\nUpon arrival in Tokyo, neon lights and giant billboards in Shinjuku's Kabukicho district set the tone for an exciting adventure. A visit to the famous Tsukiji Outer Market revealed the freshest sushi I've ever tasted, paired with a fascinating glimpse into Tokyo's fish auction culture.\n\nA bullet train ride away, Kyoto offered a tranquil contrast. Strolling through Arashiyama's bamboo forest, the soft swaying of towering stalks and gentle rustling in the wind, was meditative. The iconic Kinkaku-ji Temple (Golden Pavilion), reflecting perfectly in its surrounding pond, was a breathtaking sight.\n\nIn Osaka, the foodie paradise, I indulged in delectable street food, from crispy takoyaki to savory yakitori, in the lively Dotonbori area. The city's warm, welcoming atmosphere made it hard to leave.\n\n**Highlights:**\n- Freshest sushi at Tsukiji Outer Market, Tokyo\n- Serene bamboo forest hike in Arashiyama, Kyoto\n- Delicious street food in Dotonbori, Osaka\n\n**Duration of Trip:** 7 Days\n**Must-Pack:** Comfortable shoes, power adapter, and an empty stomach!\n\nThis brief journey through Japan was just a taste of what this incredible country has to offer, leaving me eager for a return visit.", "logprobs": [{"token": "**", "logprob": -0.0014816269977018237}, {"token": "Discover", "logprob": -0.06161908805370331}, {"token": "ing", "logprob": -4.768360213347478e-06}, {"token": " Japan", "logprob": -0.4499715566635132}, {"token": ":", "logprob": -0.08966120332479477}, {"token": " A", "logprob": -2.8609820219571702e-05}, {"token": " Wh", "logprob": -0.0680631473660469}, {"token": "irl", "logprob": -0.0022362482268363237}, {"to